Support
-------

Ask questions and share your projects in GitHub Discussions
(https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDNN/discussions). Submit feature
requests and bug reports on the GitHub issues page
(https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDNN/issues).

You can also contact oneDNN developers via UXL Foundation Slack
(https://slack-invite.uxlfoundation.org/) in the #onednn channel.

